tools.description:
Closes a theme change and deletes its preview theme, unless the merchant
published it. Use it when the user abandons the change or wants to start over;
the store can then start a new change.

pageGroup.description:
Page-group name to anchor on. Matches if any entry in the visit's `page_groups` array equals this value;
rendered steps use only the FIRST entry, so a visit matched on a non-first group appears inside a step
labeled by its first group. The sentinel `No Page Group` is rejected. Mutually exclusive with `url`.
